只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 插件：回复/提问/审批三类会话通知（系统原生 toast）+ 会话内梯子目录导航。DeepSeek Harness plugin: session notifications (reply/ask/approval) with native OS toasts + an in-conversation ladder outline.","id":"gh:1343461593","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-session-buddy","slug":"Shrbuz/dsh-session-buddy","topics":["conversation-enhancement","cordis","cordis-plugin","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","session-buddy","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 插件：回复/提问/审批三类会话通知（系统原生 toast）+ 会话内梯子目录导航。DeepSeek Harness plugin: session notificat"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ions (reply/ask/approval) with native OS toasts + an in-conversation ladder outline."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-session-buddy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> [!WARNING]\n> **This project is no longer maintained.**\n>\n> dsh web has since added the capabilitie"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s this plugin existed to fill in, so it no longer has much reason to exist. Development has stopped:"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" there will be **no further updates, releases, or support**, and issues and pull requests may go una"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"nswered.\n>\n> The repository stays online for reference only — the code, the published npm package, a"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"nd this documentation are frozen as-is. If you still want to use it, please treat it as unmaintained"},{"id":"p4s6","text":" software and check it against your dsh version before relying on it."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Session notifications + an in-conversation ladder outline for the **DeepSeek Harness Web GUI (dsh we"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"b)**. Get notified when the AI finishes replying, asks you a question, or needs command approval — e"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ven while the tab is away — and navigate past questions via a compact outline rail."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Built independently with dsh + Deepseek-V4-Flash"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Session notifications\n- **Three trigger kinds**, each independently switchable:\n- `reply`: the A"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"I finished replying\n- `ask`: the AI explicitly asks you a question (ask-user tool) — a plain finishe"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"d reply does NOT re-fire\n- `confirm`: a command approval is pending (approval dialog)\n- A reply noti"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"fies when you were **away at any point during that turn**; stays silent while you watch it\n- **Host-"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"driven + cross-tab**: triggers come from the session event log (reply on a completed turn, ask on th"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"e ask-user tool, confirm on an approval request) relayed over SSE to every open tab, and each event "},{"id":"p8s7","text":"pops **at most one OS toast** — a notified ledger claims it once across tabs and reloads; DOM observ"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ation is the fallback while the stream is down\n- **Native OS toast** (Windows PowerShell WinRT / mac"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"OS osascript / Linux notify-send) — no browser permission, not suppressed by Chrome — plus a red-dot"},{"id":"p8s10","text":" favicon & `(●)` title badge, and an optional sound\n- Title is \"workspace · session title\"; one noti"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"itle badge, and an optional sound\n- Title is \"workspace · session title\"; one notification per reply"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Ladder outline\n- A collapsible rail on the right side listing every **user question** in order\n-"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" Thin rounded bars when idle (no text, no crowding), even with dozens/hundreds of turns\n- Hover a ru"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ng for a floating tooltip (number + question summary + time); click to scroll to that turn with a fl"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ash highlight\n- Scrollspy highlights the current turn; a jump-to-latest button appears when you are "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"not at the bottom\n- Older history is paged in on demand via the \"`+older`\" footer\n- Hidden automatic"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ally when the session has fewer than two turns\n- The rail **anchors to the conversation's right edge"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" and follows it** whenever a sidebar expands/shrinks the conversation (event-driven, zero idle cost)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### In-app upgrades\n- The settings card shows the current version and can check the npm registry for"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" the latest release\n- One-click upgrade through the official `dsh plugin add` CLI (restart dsh web t"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"est release\n- One-click upgrade through the official `dsh plugin add` CLI (restart dsh web to apply)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Session cleanup\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Layer | Implementation |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Notifications | Host watches the session event log and relays reply/ask/confirm triggers over SSE "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"(`/api/session-buddy/events`) to every tab; a notified ledger claimed at the loopback-only `/api/ses"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"sion-buddy/toast` route dedupes across tabs and reloads (one OS toast per event). Client-side DOM ob"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"servation (`MutationObserver` + official anchors + the composer stop-button running signal) is the f"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"allback while the stream is down |\n| Outline | Rungs come from the official `sessions` service snaps"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"hot (independent of how much DOM is rendered); dsh conversation history is a paged window, so the ou"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"tline pages hidden history in on demand and aligns rungs to the DOM via the official anchor keys |\n|"},{"id":"p14s8","text":" Upgrades | The host reads `https://registry.npmjs.org/dsh-session-buddy/latest` (fail-closed when o"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ffline) and runs the official `dsh plugin` CLI for the actual upgrade |\n| Session cleanup | The host"},{"id":"p14s10","text":" lists sessions via `sessionPersistence`, flags corruption by replicating the harness's own load-tim"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"e message validation, and deletes a session's directory (resolved through the persistence service's "},{"id":"p14s12","text":"`locate()`, never from user input); the browser marks corrupt rows and injects the delete item into "},{"id":"p14s13","text":"the row menu |\n| Tool-run collapsing | Pure client DOM pass over the official anchor rows: `tool-cal"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"l` rows are grouped by their enclosing `turn-tail` row (the tail is only published after `turn/end`,"},{"id":"p14s15","text":" so folding happens exactly when the turn is finished), each group collapses to a \"共执行 X 步操作\" chip w"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"ith per-session expand state |\n| Transcript folding | The same official-markers pass groups a turn's"},{"id":"p14s17","text":" `assistant-step` rows (think blocks + text \"小结\" + context injections) by its `turn-tail` row into a"},{"id":"p14s18","text":" \"共 N 次思考\" chip, leaving the final summary visible; over-long `user` rows are clamped to 6 lines wit"},{"id":"p14s19","text":"h an expand bar. Both silently degrade if the official markers vanish |\n| Outline positioning | The "},{"id":"p14s20","text":"rail re-reads the conversation scrollport's right edge on resize, on container/ancestor resize, and "},{"id":"p14s21","text":"on DOM mutations (coalesced to one pass per frame), so it always moves with the conversation width |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Native toasts depend on the OS notification settings; the favicon/title badge always works as a pa"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"rallel cue\n- The \"one OS toast per event\" dedup applies to the host-driven stream; while that stream"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" is down (older host, or a connection failure) the DOM fallback notifies per tab, so several hidden "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"tabs could each pop a toast for the same event\n- Session deletion is **permanent** (no recycle bin);"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" the \"删除会话\" item is only injected into the session menu while the menu DOM is recognizable, and degr"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"ades silently otherwise\n- All folding surfaces rely on the official `data-chat-flow-kind` / `data-ch"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"at-anchor-key` markers (question clamping additionally on the `_text_` class); if a future dsh versi"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"on drops them, the plugin silently stops folding (it never hides rows it cannot confidently attribut"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"e to a finished turn)\n- An upgrade takes effect only after restarting `dsh web`"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
